Purpose:
  Phase 3 neutral GPS gameplay chrome for movement, Map readiness, status, rewards, and Cell inspection through inspect-map-cell. Its static native fog legend is exactly Shrouded, Informed, Explored, and Present. Informed reuses the Explored base treatment with one category cue; Shrouded exposes no detail; Present requires trusted physical occupancy. Reduced motion does not change these treatments, the paused banner is a semantic status, and legacy hasLoot never adds a star. MapLibre, projection, geometry, painter, route, provider, and gesture behavior remain unchanged.
